silm:instances_papers_11_base_commutative_diagram_chapters_24_rosetta_stone_cross_domain_sections_04_governance_policy_entry_point_concrete_anchor_3#internalaudittrail silm:hasLongDescription "The InternalAuditTrail is the internal-audit log: SHACL-validation timestamps, signer IDs, review history for Mittens vet records. In the paper's apparatus it appears as the symbol 'InternalAuditTrail', a concrete instance grounded in the Mittens domain story; it serves as the anchor whose semantics every diagram, formula, and prose reference back to." .
